*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0603HP-1N8
* Inductance = 1.8nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-25GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
